    "name": "StarKeeper",
    "steam_appid": 2792130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/7abfb6b69b436454eaf0f56bca9478e3.avif?t=1738768798\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/468288dd7b3eb181bba5e5751fe1e842.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/468288dd7b3eb181bba5e5751fe1e842.webm?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/468288dd7b3eb181bba5e5751fe1e842.mp4?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the asteroid! Here, you'll build a sanctuary that meets the diverse needs of residents from passing star systems! <br>Assign tasks to your robot workers, construct landing pads, and accommodate a variety of guests. Unlock new furniture, build rooms, and decide who your sanctuary caters to. Discover the needs of inhabitants from distant corners of the galaxy and see if you can fulfill them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/test_3.gif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 /></span><br><br>Explore diverse star systems, each with unique climates and inhabitants. Encounter planets ranging from icy to tropical, offering various goods for sale. Navigate threats like meteor showers, mood altering nebulas and galactic conflicts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/1f15e1dfaa7f9f65e723544bf9fca295.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/1f15e1dfaa7f9f65e723544bf9fca295.webm?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/1f15e1dfaa7f9f65e723544bf9fca295.mp4?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome a variety of guests, each with distinct preferences and needs shaped by their species and faction affiliations. Whether they're carnivores or herbivores, members of peace-loving or intolerant factions - it\u2019s up to you to make the best of their traits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/test_5.gif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 /></span><br><br>Decorate rooms in military, religious, or futuristic styles. Place tables, chairs, and specialized devices like gambling machines, decontaminators and fuel distributors. Unlock better furniture through faction interactions and manage room access based on guest preferences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/aa94fa5ea86a1265a2787656116eb58a.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/aa94fa5ea86a1265a2787656116eb58a.webm?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/aa94fa5ea86a1265a2787656116eb58a.mp4?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use varied kitchen equipment to experiment with ingredients and cater to guests' needs. Unlock asteroid harvesting, build processing machines, greenhouses and worm nests, to make your asteroid more self-sustaining.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/360b4251c1ba4f4842ad4ba14e3d2921.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/360b4251c1ba4f4842ad4ba14e3d2921.webm?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/360b4251c1ba4f4842ad4ba14e3d2921.mp4?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seek help from allied factions during crises and events. Enjoy discounts on products from friendly planets. Make choices - which of the two conflicted factions will you support? Can you afford to suffer the retaliation of their enemies?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/7abfb6b69b436454eaf0f56bca9478e3.avif?t=1738768798\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/468288dd7b3eb181bba5e5751fe1e842.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/468288dd7b3eb181bba5e5751fe1e842.webm?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/468288dd7b3eb181bba5e5751fe1e842.mp4?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the asteroid! Here, you'll build a sanctuary that meets the diverse needs of residents from passing star systems! <br>Assign tasks to your robot workers, construct landing pads, and accommodate a variety of guests. Unlock new furniture, build rooms, and decide who your sanctuary caters to. Discover the needs of inhabitants from distant corners of the galaxy and see if you can fulfill them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/test_3.gif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 /></span><br><br>Explore diverse star systems, each with unique climates and inhabitants. Encounter planets ranging from icy to tropical, offering various goods for sale. Navigate threats like meteor showers, mood altering nebulas and galactic conflicts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/1f15e1dfaa7f9f65e723544bf9fca295.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source sr