ass=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/360b4251c1ba4f4842ad4ba14e3d2921.poster.avif?t=1738768798\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/360b4251c1ba4f4842ad4ba14e3d2921.webm?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792130/extras/360b4251c1ba4f4842ad4ba14e3d2921.mp4?t=1738768798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seek help from allied factions during crises and events. Enjoy discounts on products from friendly planets. Make choices - which of the two conflicted factions will you support? Can you afford to suffer the retaliation of their enemies?",
